## Fix Details

### ✅ GAP-001: SioOutcome Type Mismatch - FIXED

**File:** `brain/master/src/outcome.rs`

**Before:**
```rust
pub struct SioOutcome {
    pub status: String,
    pub result: Vec<u8>,
    pub answer: String,
    // ... other fields
}
```

**After:**
```rust
pub enum SioOutcome {
    Success {
        text: String,
        tokens: Vec<u32>,
    },
    Error {
        message: String,
        details: String,
    },
}
```

**Files Updated:**
- `brain/master/src/outcome.rs` - Converted to enum
- `brain/master/src/provider/candle.rs` - Uses `SioOutcome::Success`
- `brain/master/src/provider/mock.rs` - Uses `SioOutcome::Success`
- `brain/master/src/kernel/hacedle.rs` - Uses `SioOutcome::Success`

