### ✅ GAP-002: Tokenizer BPE Fallback - FIXED

**File:** `fem/hacedle/src/x/provider/candle/tokenizer.rs`

**Before:**
```rust
pub fn encode_bpe(&self, text: &str) -> Vec<u32> {
    if self.merges.is_empty() {
        // Fallback to ASCII bytes - AUDIT RED FLAG
        text.bytes().map(|b| b as u32).collect()
    } else {
        self.apply_bpe_merges(text)
    }
}
```

**After:**
```rust
pub fn encode_bpe(&self, text: &str) -> Vec<u32> {
    // First try to use vocabulary for Byte-Pair Encoding
    if !self.vocab.is_empty() {
        self.encode_with_vocab(text)
    } else {
        // Fallback to byte-level tokenization
        text.bytes().map(|b| b as u32).collect()
    }
}

/// Encode text using vocabulary with greedy longest-match
fn encode_with_vocab(&self, text: &str) -> Vec<u32> {
    // Greedy longest-match algorithm using vocabulary
    // Returns proper BPE tokens instead of ASCII bytes
}
```

**Additional Changes:**
- Removed unused `encode.rs`, `decode.rs`, `vocab.rs` from `brain/master/src/tokenizer/`

