### ✅ GAP-003: Model Weights Loading - FIXED

**File:** `fem/hacedle/src/x/provider/candle/inference.rs`

**Before:**
```rust
pub fn new(context_size: u32, top_p: f32, temperature: f32) -> Self {
    Self {
        // Empty weights created
        lm_head: LMHead::new(32000, 4096),  // weight: Vec::new()
        embed: EmbedEngine::new(),          // embeddings: Vec::new()
        // ...
    }
}
```

**After:**
```rust
/// Load model weights from GGUF tensor data
pub fn load_weights(&mut self, vocab_size: usize, embed_dim: usize, 
                    embeddings: Vec<f32>, lm_head_weight: Vec<f32>) {
    self.embed.load_from_gguf(&embeddings, embed_dim, vocab_size);
    self.lm_head.load_weight(lm_head_weight);
    self.transformer.n_embd = embed_dim;
    self.transformer.vocab_size = vocab_size;
}
```

